{"api_note":"FFmpeg 9.1 via ffmpeg-the-third 6.0: demux/decode/scale/resample/filter are safe wrappers. Manual/unsafe gaps: (1) seek takes RangeBounds, there is no SeekRange::Backward -> used ..=ts which maps to avformat_seek_file(min=MIN, ts, max=ts); (2) buffer source args need the numeric AVPixelFormat, so AVPixelFormat::from(pixel).0 is taken from ffmpeg::ffi; (3) frame data is stride/linesize padded, so RGB24 rows are hashed row-by-row and audio is clamped to samples*channels*4; (4) decoder + resampler need explicit EOF/drain and flush loops; (5) filter graph: buffer/buffersink + the parsed filter are added with the safe Graph::add, but the safe Parser did not connect them (buffer output pad left unconnected), so the three pads are wired with unsafe ffmpeg::ffi::avfilter_link; (6) the safe resampler allocates its output from input.samples() and truncates 44.1k->48k, so the probe allocates the output frame itself.","bytes":933120000,"checksum":2394360506412143380,"codec":"hevc","decode_ms":1627.9778999999999,"first_pts":0,"fps":92.13884291672511,"fps_nominal":30.0,"frames":150,"height":1080,"last_pts":4966666,"mode":"video-seq","pix_fmt":"YUV420P","requested":150,"tool":"third","width":1920}
